---------------------------- MODUL Counter ----------------------------
(* A bounded counter: a minimal spec to verify your setup works. *)
MENGGUNAKAN HimpunanBilanganAsli

KONSTANTA Max
VARIABEL count

Init == count = 0

Increment == count < Max DAN count' = count + 1
Reset     == count = Max DAN count' = 0

Next == Increment ATAU Reset

Spec == Init DAN SELALU [Next] ATAU STUTTERING count

TypeOK == count DALAM 0..Max
=============================================================================
